'''Going Stones''' (ゴーイングストーンズ, ''Gōingu Sutōnzu'', '''Going Stones''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

